			"notes": "Finally putting this on github after... too long.\n\n## Changelog:\n\n\nAdded dimensional blacklist! Currently only configurable by editing the config file directly.\n\nRewrote the config menu (well, actually the entire mod, but that's less relevant)\n\n   - Config options now use sliders instead of text entries, making them much easier to use!\n\n   - Config menu now has a transparent background and changes in settings will show up live!\n\nAdded a seperate slider to change the linear fog end distance!"
		},
